ComfyUI-DiffHDR
Copyright 2026 Claus Steinmassl

This product is a ComfyUI integration of DiffHDR
(https://github.com/Eyeline-Labs/DiffHDR, Apache-2.0) by Eyeline Labs.
Mask detection, the log encoding curve and the long-video blending scheme are
ported from that project.

DiffHDR builds on DiffSynth-Studio (Apache-2.0) and Wan 2.1 (Apache-2.0).
The DiffHDR LoRA weights (https://huggingface.co/Eyeline-Labs/DiffHDR, Apache-2.0)
are downloaded at runtime and are not part of this repository.
